      "GAP 3 – APPRAISAL RIGHT-TO-RECEIVE NOTICE (HIGH PRIORITY – HPML OBLIGATION): No evidence of required notice under 12 CFR § 1026.35(c)(5). WHY IT MATTERS: For HPML transactions, the creditor must notify the applicant of the right to receive appraisals within 3 business days of application. Required by March 20, 2024. MINIMUM ACCEPTABLE EVIDENCE: Copy of the notice with issuance date; delivery confirmation (mailing certificate, email, or signed acknowledgment). RECOMMENDED ACTION: Search the file and LOS for the notice; if not delivered, document as a regulatory violation and assess remediation options.",
